      "text": "MR = 100 - 4Q. Set MR = MC: 100 - 4Q = 20 -> Q = 20. P = 100 - 2(20) = 60. Profit = (P - ATC)Q. ATC = TC/Q. If TC = 20Q + 100, ATC = 20 + 5 = 25. Profit = (60-25)x20 = 700",
